ng. They find bakuchiol, made from the babchi plant, appealing. It's a natural option that offers mild anti-aging benefits without the dryness some vitamin A products cause.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Those with sensitive skin often find bakuchiol helpful. It's also considered safer for pregnant or breastfeeding women than retinol. But, it's always best to talk to a doctor first. Doing a patch test can also prevent any unexpected skin reactions.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFzJwdBANI_label","label":"ggFzJwdBANI_label","default":"Buy It Now"}],
